<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Stilfontein falls into pre-capex loss.</title>
<headline>Stilfontein falls into pre-capex loss.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-September versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss before capital spending     0.51 vs 1.36 profit</p>
<p>    Capital recoupment			 2.13 vs 0.60</p>
<p>Tonnes milled</p>
<p>	- Surface				   nil vs 4,000</p>
<p>Gold output (kg)</p>
<p>	- Surface				    44 vs   127</p>
<p>Yield (gram/t)</p>
<p>	- Surface				   nil vs 31.75</p>
<p>Cost (rand/kg)</p>
<p>	- Surface				53,447 vs 41,055</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)			56,591 vs 53,449</p>
<p>Full name: Stilfontein Gold Mining Co Ltd, managed by Randgold and Exploration Co Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The gold plant has been shut down and demolition will commence during the next quarter. Gold recovered for the current quarter was from mine concentrates.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
